(7426206, 1172703, 103142, '<td valign="top">Another one that challenges my idea of calm. Captivity does not seem in the slightest calming, so it immediately seemed to not fit the challenge. But I also think you must get incredibly bored in captivity -- and the one on the right certainly seems bored. The one on camera left seems sad. :(<br/> <br/>Ok, I''ve looked too long at this one. It is sad. But calm. 8</td>', 'Another one that challenges my idea of calm. Captivity does not seem in the slightest calming, so it immediately seemed to not fit the challenge. But I also think you must get incredibly bored in captivity -- and the one on the right certainly seems bored. The one on camera left seems sad. :( Ok, I''ve looked too long at this one. It is sad. But calm. 8', '2016-01-07 12:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
