(7426554, 1172713, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> Great image. How did you manage to mount EF-S lens on 6D?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This lens works on FF cameras.  You just need to shoot it at 16mm, any wider and it starts to vignette very quickly.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: Great image. How did you manage to mount EF-S lens on 6D??   This lens works on FF cameras.  You just need to shoot it at 16mm, any wider and it starts to vignette very quickly.', '2016-01-08 13:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
