(7427142, 1172872, 19825, '<td valign="top">Soulless? I don''t know about that. Perhaps this photo does not tell a story, but it definitely captures the quiet beauty of nature in the scene. <br/> <br/>However, I can relate to your concern. I just think I can look through some of my recent entries and find images that better illustrate this concern. There are images that I might categorize as mildly pleasant but with no redeeming value. I do need to work this year to give voters some meatier images. Something that can be savored. And, not worry too much bout the voters only looking for immediate gratification.</td>', 'Soulless? I don''t know about that. Perhaps this photo does not tell a story, but it definitely captures the quiet beauty of nature in the scene.  However, I can relate to your concern. I just think I can look through some of my recent entries and find images that better illustrate this concern. There are images that I might categorize as mildly pleasant but with no redeeming value. I do need to work this year to give voters some meatier images. Something that can be savored. And, not worry too much bout the voters only looking for immediate gratification.', '2016-01-11 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
